<description>&lt;p&gt;Fitgharan forces continue to hold the Mogadishu-Baidoa corridor while Laftagareen forces have taken Buurhakaba and opposition fighters have seized a third town in a week, intensifying fighting in the Bay region. Ethiopia is reported to be supporting al-Shabaab militants in the Southwest State and is planning a troop withdrawal from Somalia as fighting intensifies at home. Somalia is screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case and is deepening defence ties with Pakistan by agreeing to acquire JF‑17 fighter jets. The ICRC says 148 wounded were treated after heavy fighting in Baidoa town, and there were 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOR0cxVVRVejVZYUxfelFDWnhNdUc2Q2ZWbnN3VlR6eURScktsLUxkcVh0RllENUw1a0ZvdU45MkJuZVk1THNxMkt0M1FoOUFKSF9mNGZjYXBnTnRfN1MweGsyRncxUW1wYnJtNDBWdVJtVTc3S0ZFNEhXOFJGYXdCbmdlcnVSN09NSk5sQVZ6czUzMURxWEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQRW85eEVLNVFGTnVmWllYX0xLTmM0Sk56Tkozd1UyVUlnQ29kSVRJOEtNVi13aW1rb2c3WWhIdkVSOXRDSDZsRFZXdWdQQi1EbUNhVHR2WFNOZC1pQ2ZCbTBJTXpfdjBYSXJKLWlybGRqM1ZjTUlMbk5JaUVDNTNpREVsMU5IeHl2NTEyTWxsVncwNmtGMHBiN3FNcjkzSUJxSlJkZm1BSVpDUkhYaVotMWhR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPcVhta2w4UlRHaEVsQXptaThwUVVqY0JQN1d0VW5IYlNkcERWYVJWOTFuRUZLZVhRN21kM1I5QUJ5V1o1eTJncUxWZC1ZWmVncXppTUZnMGx5aG12ZVg3VjRuMlJibERCM0U4a0pKcFUxZlh5emJLWmVRaW1OM21HUlhUUXdrOEhQcW9zc1lucE5iSmxpUG1DbjdzV3ZvTTdjQ3praVFRV1c0N1JELXB5QVJtdXBEaXZiTW15OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &l